nodes.body:
Thank you, @DarkLight1337 and @liulanze!

@simon-mo, do you want `--api-key` to guard all routes by default? If not, I will close this PR.

@liulanze, both of your points are correct:

1. With `--root-path /`, `/health` returns 401. I will use `get_route_path`, as #52794 does.
2. `HTTPVLLMWeightSyncClient` sends no key, so the weight-sync routes return 401.

I will fix these two points only if this change is accepted.

